# A TF2 gun's first-person muzzle flash at two view-model fields of view
# (`tf2_viewmodel_fov` 54, TF2's, and 80): the flash should sit on the
# barrel at both (it is drawn by the view-model camera:
# `StartParticleSystem::view_model`). On the greybox, looking at a wall.
#   cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1280x720 +volume 0 +sandbox \
#       --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/tf2_flash_fov.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 120
god
sandbox ammo on
rung tf2:tf_weapon_smg
wait 2
wait_for idle 3000
wait 120
setang 0 90
tf2_viewmodel_fov 54
wait 30
shot_after shot 1 flash_fov54
+attack
wait 20
-attack
wait 60
tf2_viewmodel_fov 80
wait 30
shot_after shot 1 flash_fov80
+attack
wait 20
-attack
wait 30
